      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "1e1d41e3684f78aac78857a62230c4d7c7e6e202d419074a1e90a52611b94d43:000000_-3785423101439314006:g0:r7",
      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "主人公は「モンスター娘を労わる会」のために\nまずは飲み物の準備をしようと森で果物を集めていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "9ca3946b07ef5034c749a57e22ef5dd518a45f417d4addd30effb2434b0d40da",
