      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "57ef4a3df788a9a6c7d3860d2504f59ad77429a0ee002e8a0bf7ff931a676a82",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ううう、ですよね。\nはあ、僕だけだと限界がありますし、\nみなさんが戻られたら手伝って貰って……あれ？",
      "jp_sha256": "1c2027eadedcfc915d137f477e83846a6568ea6932578c3a9f5a292048708a94",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "으으, 그렇죠.\n하아, 저 혼자서는 한계가 있으니\n여러분이 돌아오면 도와달라고…… 어라?",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 11,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "1e1d41e3684f78aac78857a62230c4d7c7e6e202d419074a1e90a52611b94d43:000000_-3785423101439314006:g0:r10",
      "row_index_0based": 10,
      "serialized_row_index": 10,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ううう、ですよね。\nはあ、僕だけだと限界がありますし、\nみなさんが戻られたら手伝って貰って……あれ？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "d599479de5f842807f354222ace65614111d23a38cd191d2b95ad4008d91a3a6",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "そういえばみなさん、\n戻ってくるのが少し遅いような……。",
      "jp_sha256": "d9b6e26dedbe780408918398f31201e2754b8271daf93968a99d38197f955e93",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그러고 보니 여러분,\n돌아오는 게 조금 늦는 것 같은데…….",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 12,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "1e1d41e3684f78aac78857a62230c4d7c7e6e202d419074a1e90a52611b94d43:000000_-3785423101439314006:g0:r11",
      "row_index_0based": 11,
      "serialized_row_index": 11,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "そういえばみなさん、\n戻ってくるのが少し遅いような……。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "853ac2ab00d1ddf0d1738bc773ee60ff15c7533a43f37605a7cc79b0c3c35610",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 5,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ふむ、たしかにそうですね。\n……怪しい犯行予告も出されましたし、\n何者かに妨害されている可能性もありますよ。",
      "jp_sha256": "cf453779ad60253afe5fd66b8efbdee62073c20705a445f7967a07a805378b35",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "흠, 그러게요.\n……수상한 범행 예고도 있었고,\n누군가에게 방해받고 있을 가능성도 있습니다.",
      "message_index_0based": 5,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 13,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
