        "",
        "ビビ神",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "ふむ、たしかにそうですね。\n……怪しい犯行予告も出されましたし、\n何者かに妨害されている可能性もありますよ。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ビビ神",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "34b45e927eaff6bbebc9a2d810cd809602d8d479e0cec7aa4d249c0a0dee32f4",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 6,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "そ、そうですね！\n心配ですし、ちょっと様子を見にいきましょう！",
      "jp_sha256": "0d6b42d415f8c37c37d81937f9a4977b5fe94a86be1392419071d8c261f514e2",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그, 그렇네요!\n걱정되니 잠깐 상태를 보러 가죠!",
      "message_index_0based": 6,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 14,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "1e1d41e3684f78aac78857a62230c4d7c7e6e202d419074a1e90a52611b94d43:000000_-3785423101439314006:g0:r13",
      "row_index_0based": 13,
      "serialized_row_index": 13,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "そ、そうですね！\n心配ですし、ちょっと様子を見にいきましょう！"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "56a09240412682be97f766dac189c1ef1966916b5fb8fce12d326f04dda907a1",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 7,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "そうして集めた果物をいったん置いて、\n主人公とビビ神は山にやってきていた。",
      "jp_sha256": "1c3d75660991f1a8ae19b05a7ceb6bf93ca9e8d8c9f35759af533ae63a778acf",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그렇게 모은 과일을 일단 내려놓고\n주인공과 비비 신은 산으로 향했다.",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 24,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "1e1d41e3684f78aac78857a62230c4d7c7e6e202d419074a1e90a52611b94d43:000000_-3785423101439314006:g0:r23",
      "row_index_0based": 23,
      "serialized_row_index": 23,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "そうして集めた果物をいったん置いて、\n主人公とビビ神は山にやってきていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "959ca1edfb83a03ad29a9a9b26d6696430fa57bf17ec8beb2fe4041cf9011d47",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "――えっと、たしかフランシさんは、\n山に住むモンスター娘さんたちに\n招待状を渡しに行くって――。",
      "jp_sha256": "3fb49b4385135f8b64cd742fa5f83a07c6e4912269b04b3e63d9e067b753eaa8",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "――그러니까, 분명 프란시 씨는\n산에 사는 몬스터 소녀들에게\n초대장을 전달하러 간다고――.",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 25,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "1e1d41e3684f78aac78857a62230c4d7c7e6e202d419074a1e90a52611b94d43:000000_-3785423101439314006:g0:r24",
      "row_index_0based": 24,
      "serialized_row_index": 24,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "――えっと、たしかフランシさんは、\n山に住むモンスター娘さんたちに\n招待状を渡しに行くって――。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "feb517aaa0c5b667dd3d3ca52bb2917ee1e7631289fb2d160f2a3d6908d0bf10",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "うわあっ、地面が揺れてるぅ！？\nいったい何が！？",
      "jp_sha256": "0d6ce127d9b7938a0869a6753f98b0f710db94c7281c24bf7b3e6fe07678c872",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "으아악, 땅이 흔들려!?\n대체 무슨 일이죠!?",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 31,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "1e1d41e3684f78aac78857a62230c4d7c7e6e202d419074a1e90a52611b94d43:000000_-3785423101439314006:g0:r30",
      "row_index_0based": 30,
      "serialized_row_index": 30,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "うわあっ、地面が揺れてるぅ！？\nいったい何が！？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "5b8f9d69a0bb4e1aea9d5ec5386785281067f995dd9dabbfeb0a3e6db6b73b0a",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 10,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "こら待てー！\nオレッち絶対に許さないぞー！　どりゃああ！！",
      "jp_sha256": "f8263c21e0ac8fa3188f6711327ea9e4589cf1c100b0a06d5372f8abab5c6e30",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "거기 서!\n난 절대로 용서 못 해! 이랴아아!!",
      "message_index_0based": 10,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 34,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
